<title>INDONESIA: Cibinong 1996 net up to 105.39 bln rph.</title>
<headline>Cibinong 1996 net up to 105.39 bln rph.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twelve months to December 1996</p>
<p>					 (in billion rupiah unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net income			  105.39  vs   92.02</p>
<p>    Earnings per share (rupiah)    642    vs    560</p>
<p>    Net sales			   768.27  vs  694.84</p>
<p>    Gross profit			245.0   vs  235.93</p>
<p>    Operating profit		  189.08  vs  192.95</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit		    105.57  vs  102.16</p>
<p>    Retained earnings		 341.09  vs  260.34</p>
<p>NOTE: The consolidated results were audited. PT Semen Cibinong is one of Indonesian's large cement companies.</p>
<p>--- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364</p>
</text>
